  "private": true,
  "license": "MIT",
  "description": "lyteboat's side model calls: one prompt a plugin sends for an agent (a routing decision, an intake classification) under its own deadline, recorded in the agent's session as an ignorable lyteboat/aux-llm-call record. Config: reasoningEffort, the effort every side call requests (an id the routes' adapter defines)",
